nextNodeIds":[790610206]},{"nodeId":790610206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21448,"speakerName":"エスノワール","textMapHash":4238861746,"text":"本当か？…外の世界には「価値」しか存在しないんだと思ってたよ。帽子を被りたいのに、その勇気はない…そんな人ばっかりだとね。","nextNodeIds":[790610207]},{"nodeId":790610207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2986753946,"text":"それは…まあ、その…ケ、ケーキの上のチョコチップみたいに、どれも違う味っていうか。","nextNodeIds":[790610208]},{"nodeId":790610208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1839761866,"text":"チョコチップが全部同じ味だったら、ケーキも美味しくなくなっちゃうだろ？","nextNodeIds":[790610209,790610210]},{"nodeId":790610209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":290996530,"text":"パイモン、いいこと言うね。","nextNodeIds":[790610211]},{"nodeId":790610211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3498803482,"text":"あれだけ話を聞かされたら、少しは身につくぞ。へへっ、なかなか理にかなってただろ？","nextNodeIds":[790610212]},{"nodeId":790610212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21448,"speakerName":"エスノワール","textMapHash":2537253410,"text":"そうなのか？も…もう少し考えさせてくれ…もしかしたら…ちょっとだけ旅に出てみるのも、悪くないかもしれない…？","nextNodeIds":[790610213]},{"nodeId":790610213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21450,"speakerName":"ローゼル","textMapHash":1958059954,"text":"焦る必要はない、エスノワール。次の出航日まで、まだまだ時間はあるから、一緒に考えよう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":790610210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1599198482,"text":"パイモン、完全にここに溶け込んでるね…","nextNodeIds":[790610211]},{"nodeId":790610204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3027194842,"text":"永遠に色褪せない輝かしい理想や…","nextNodeIds":[790610206]},{"nodeId":790610205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":816250034,"text":"夢に向かって努力する人たちもいる。","nextNodeIds":[790610206]}]},{"talkId":7906103,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCamer